<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:11.000" end="00:00:15.500" style="s2">The flower of immortality.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.800" end="00:00:17.300" style="s2">What a joke.</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.500" end="00:00:20.300" style="s2">Sounds like it&#39;s designed to kill dumb</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.300" end="00:00:20.300" style="s2">people like us.</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.000" end="00:00:28.100" style="s2">Then stop talking.</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.100" end="00:00:28.100" style="s2">We might survive.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.500" end="00:00:45.195" style="s2">Man, those horses look delicious. Should</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.200" end="00:00:47.215" style="s2">have brought some sauce.</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.195" end="00:00:47.215" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.500" end="00:00:53.000" style="s2">You forgot to bring your weapon.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.300" end="00:00:55.900" style="s2">But somehow you look more disappointed</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.000" end="00:00:55.900" style="s2">about the sauce.</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.500" end="00:01:07.800" style="s2">Well, look at that.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.740" end="00:01:12.760" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.900" end="00:01:22.600" style="s2">Weapons are for decoration.</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.000" end="00:01:27.700" style="s2">I do not depend on them.</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.770" end="00:01:29.790" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.100" end="00:01:35.400" style="s2">All right, show off.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.000" end="00:01:38.100" style="s2">Now put those fists to work and roast us</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.400" end="00:01:38.100" style="s2">some meat.</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.906" end="00:01:40.926" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.692" end="00:02:28.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell?</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.692" end="00:02:45.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, well, well.</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.292" end="00:02:49.192" style="s2">What a lovely surprise.</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.892" end="00:02:49.192" style="s2">I can&#39;t stop drooling.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.292" end="00:02:55.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good day.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.992" end="00:02:57.506" style="s2">How did you gentlemen know that I WAS</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.892" end="00:02:59.526" style="s2">HUNGRY?</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.506" end="00:02:59.526" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.892" end="00:03:05.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HEY LIZARD.</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.192" end="00:03:07.992" style="s2">DO YOU KNOW ANYTHING ABOUT flower of</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.092" end="00:03:07.992" style="s2">immortality?</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.092" end="00:03:16.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m 300 years old and I&#39;ve never died.</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.592" end="00:03:17.592" style="s2">Who knows? Maybe you are already</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.092" end="00:03:20.592" style="s2">immortal.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.592" end="00:03:20.592" style="s2">Want me to find out?</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.692" end="00:03:27.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah, that&#39;s cute.</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.592" end="00:03:27.692" style="s2">Now try answering the question.</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.892" end="00:03:33.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen here, baldy.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.992" end="00:03:36.892" style="s2">I will [snorts] chop you into little</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.392" end="00:03:40.492" style="s2">pieces, drown you in my poison sauce,</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.892" end="00:03:40.492" style="s2">and call it tonight&#39;s special.</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.837" end="00:03:55.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.177" end="00:04:14.197" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.194" end="00:04:19.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Time&#39;s up.</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.694" end="00:04:23.194" style="s2">This is the last face you will see</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.894" end="00:04:23.194" style="s2">before you die.</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.294" end="00:04:42.794" style="s2">Man, ever tried eating a giant lizard?</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.994" end="00:04:42.794" style="s2">Bet that thing tastes terrible.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.694" end="00:04:48.394" style="s2">I don&#39;t eat talking animals.</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.894" end="00:04:52.394" style="s2">Brother, you&#39;re getting soft.</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.994" end="00:05:34.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thousands of years ago, deep within the</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.094" end="00:05:37.594" style="s2">forgotten swamp, there existed an island</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.794" end="00:05:38.894" style="s2">inhabited by a rare species known as the</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.594" end="00:05:40.194" style="s2">Lavania.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.894" end="00:05:43.094" style="s2">Lavania.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.194" end="00:05:45.294" style="s2">They are peaceful creatures by nature.</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.094" end="00:05:47.694" style="s2">They lived in harmony with the land and</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.294" end="00:05:50.494" style="s2">possessed lifespans spanning thousands</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.694" end="00:05:50.494" style="s2">of years.</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.594" end="00:06:08.195" style="s2">But for reasons unknown,</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.194" end="00:06:12.495" style="s2">the Lavania began to perish one by one</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.195" end="00:06:12.495" style="s2">until their entire species vanished.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.595" end="00:06:18.095" style="s2">From the blood of the fallen Lavanya,</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.095" end="00:06:21.995" style="s2">extraordinary trees emerged, each</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.095" end="00:06:24.195" style="s2">bearing a single magnificent flower.</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.995" end="00:06:26.795" style="s2">Its essence could multiply a mortal&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.195" end="00:06:29.495" style="s2">lifespan tenfold.</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.795" end="00:06:32.795" style="s2">Today, only a handful of these flowers</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.495" end="00:06:32.795" style="s2">are believed to remain.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.995" end="00:06:42.395" style="s2">And so they became known throughout the</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.095" end="00:06:42.395" style="s2">ages as the flowers of immortality.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.395" end="00:06:54.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Woo!</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.295" end="00:06:58.295" style="s2">Look at that! 1 2 3 4 5</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.495" end="00:06:58.295" style="s2">5 giant moose running over there.</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.695" end="00:07:12.995" style="s2">Should we ask them for a lift?</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.095" end="00:07:17.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t smile, man. You&#39;ll scare them off.</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.795" end="00:07:29.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The big ONE IS MY RIDE.</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.695" end="00:07:38.505" style="s2">HEY, GOMA.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.595" end="00:07:40.525" style="s2">AM I A GENIUS OR WHAT?</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.505" end="00:07:40.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.095" end="00:07:48.330" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YEAH, YEAH.</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.695" end="00:07:50.350" style="s2">YOU&#39;RE smarter than you look.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.330" end="00:07:50.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.095" end="00:07:54.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Heck yeah!</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.795" end="00:07:57.495" style="s2">Wait, what?</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.395" end="00:08:07.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wake me up if you find any food.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.595" end="00:08:07.195" style="s2">I&#39;m going.</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.966" end="00:09:06.986" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.697" end="00:09:26.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the?</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.897" end="00:09:32.697" style="s2">Hey sleepy head, wake up.</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.397" end="00:09:36.597" style="s2">Did you find the food?</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.897" end="00:09:41.497" style="s2">Something doesn&#39;t feel right.</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.997" end="00:09:44.797" style="s2">Stay sharp.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.097" end="00:09:48.397" style="s2">Look.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.497" end="00:10:02.597" style="s2">I feel like those guys are staring at</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.297" end="00:10:02.597" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.897" end="00:10:06.097" style="s2">Let&#39;s take another route.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.197" end="00:10:13.198" style="s2">Why? Are you feeling shy?</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.017" end="00:10:19.037" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.602" end="00:10:23.622" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.222" end="00:10:29.517" style="s2">[bell]</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.098" end="00:10:29.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lovers of immortality. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.698" end="00:10:32.898" style="s2">How predictable.</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.698" end="00:10:40.597" style="s2">Looks like those brave fools have lost</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.098" end="00:10:42.617" style="s2">their way.</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.597" end="00:10:42.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.457" end="00:10:50.477" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.207" end="00:11:25.298" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.698" end="00:11:25.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I smell smoke and fire.</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.298" end="00:11:56.098" style="s2">Fire breathers.</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.123" end="00:12:24.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.638" end="00:12:32.658" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.299" end="00:12:53.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The fire burning within me is hotter</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.099" end="00:12:53.199" style="s2">than these flames.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.499" end="00:13:21.099" style="s2">More fire breathers [music] are coming.</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.999" end="00:13:24.799" style="s2">I got this.</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.699" end="00:13:36.799" style="s2">You brought this on [music] yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.599" end="00:13:36.799" style="s2">Dark Ascension.</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.689" end="00:13:44.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.301" end="00:14:35.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see a flood of fire breathers coming</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.501" end="00:14:37.601" style="s2">our way. Tonight, I&#39;ll wipe out their</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.201" end="00:14:41.701" style="s2">entire species. They&#39;re nothing but a</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.601" end="00:14:41.701" style="s2">waste of our time. Let&#39;s move.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.501" end="00:15:11.601" style="s2">I can&#39;t shake this feeling. Someone or</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.101" end="00:15:11.601" style="s2">something is watching us.</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.101" end="00:15:18.801" style="s2">People always get shy around me.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.901" end="00:15:18.801" style="s2">I wonder why.</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.595" end="00:15:23.615" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.180" end="00:15:28.200" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.101" end="00:15:36.401" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong with this fog?</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.901" end="00:15:49.101" style="s2">Where are we?</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.401" end="00:15:49.101" style="s2">It feels like another world.</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.101" end="00:16:01.301" style="s2">We&#39;ve been traveling for hours,</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.601" end="00:16:01.301" style="s2">and there&#39;s no end to this place.</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.701" end="00:16:09.001" style="s2">I see a dead tree over there.</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.201" end="00:16:10.601" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.001" end="00:16:13.101" style="s2">Looks like someone&#39;s chained to that</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.601" end="00:16:13.101" style="s2">tree.</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.202" end="00:16:44.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Greetings, travelers.</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.102" end="00:16:44.202" style="s2">What brings you here?</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.402" end="00:16:51.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you tied to that tree?</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.002" end="00:16:53.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because it is quiet here,</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.702" end="00:16:55.902" style="s2">peaceful,</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.102" end="00:16:58.802" style="s2">a place to simply observe and experience</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.902" end="00:16:58.802" style="s2">existence.</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.202" end="00:17:06.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know you can do all that without the</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.002" end="00:17:08.602" style="s2">chance, right?</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.702" end="00:17:11.302" style="s2">What is this place?</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.602" end="00:17:14.002" style="s2">It stretches endlessly with no direction</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.302" end="00:17:17.002" style="s2">and no end.</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.002" end="00:17:17.002" style="s2">Do you know a way out?</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.202" end="00:17:23.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I may know the answers you seek,</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.602" end="00:17:25.802" style="s2">but I have no reason to give them to</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.502" end="00:17:25.802" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.002" end="00:17:30.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sharing a little knowledge wouldn&#39;t cost</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.002" end="00:17:33.902" style="s2">you anything.</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.902" end="00:17:36.302" style="s2">Why so selfish?</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.902" end="00:17:38.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Selfish?</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.302" end="00:17:43.002" style="s2">I am not bound by the laws, customs, or</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.802" end="00:17:46.102" style="s2">moral expectations of your society.</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.002" end="00:17:49.602" style="s2">The very concepts of right and wrong</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.102" end="00:17:49.602" style="s2">hold no meaning for me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.202" end="00:17:54.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow.</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.502" end="00:17:56.802" style="s2">So basically</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.802" end="00:17:58.102" style="s2">you do whatever you want.</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.802" end="00:18:00.602" style="s2">But what if someone tries to burn you</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.102" end="00:18:00.602" style="s2">alive?</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.402" end="00:18:08.502" style="s2">Would you answer their questions then?</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.402" end="00:18:08.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never thought about it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.302" end="00:18:14.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s find out then.</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.652" end="00:18:26.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps and panting]</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.307" end="00:18:28.503" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.603" end="00:18:32.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is happening?</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.503" end="00:18:32.303" style="s2">My body is moving on its own.</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.803" end="00:18:41.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are only alive because I find your</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.703" end="00:18:41.603" style="s2">stupidity mildly amusing.</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.203" end="00:18:47.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I tried to be peaceful,</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.903" end="00:18:51.403" style="s2">but you left me no choice.</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.803" end="00:19:02.603" style="s2">Now either show us a way out of here or</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.303" end="00:19:02.603" style="s2">I will cut you in half.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.303" end="00:19:10.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do your worst, warrior.</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.603" end="00:19:10.203" style="s2">Let me see what you are made of.</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.803" end="00:19:20.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It does not matter how powerful you are.</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.703" end="00:19:20.103" style="s2">There is no escape from this.</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.503" end="00:19:24.003" style="s2">DIMENSION SLASH!</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.503" end="00:19:40.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WAIT.</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.303" end="00:19:44.003" style="s2">I JUST SAW THE future</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.003" end="00:19:44.003" style="s2">and I did not like what I saw.</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.003" end="00:19:51.803" style="s2">I know you have been searching for the</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.603" end="00:19:54.703" style="s2">flower of immortality.</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.803" end="00:19:57.803" style="s2">As a parting gift, I can send you to the</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.703" end="00:19:59.703" style="s2">island deep within the jungle</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.803" end="00:20:02.103" style="s2">where you may find what you are looking</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.703" end="00:20:02.103" style="s2">for.</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.003" end="00:20:19.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you subscribe to my channel?</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.403" end="00:20:21.503" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.603" end="00:20:24.003" style="s2">I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.503" end="00:20:24.003" style="s2">Okay.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
